message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it."
title: "Étoile & Lumière: macOS research apps for Gen Z TikTok analysis"
authors:
  - family-names: Gong
    given-names: Xiaoli
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-06"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SallyGong310-Lily/etoile-lumiere"
abstract: >-
  Étoile samples TikTok hashtags and filters creators by market (France, United
  Kingdom, global). Lumière analyses selected videos for structure, audience,
  tone, visuals, engagement, culture and trend representation, producing an
  Excel/Markdown evidence pack. Research tooling; not affiliated with TikTok.
